    <preface>
      <p>Help to Buy (Consequential Provisions) Act 2024</p>
      <p>No. 125, 2024</p>
      <p>An Act to deal with consequential matters arising from the enactment of the <i>Help to</i> <i>Buy Act 2024</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments	3</p>
      <p>Housing Australia Act 2018	3</p>
      <p>Help to Buy (Consequential Provisions) Act 2024</p>
      <p>No. 125, 2024</p>
      <p>An Act to deal with consequential matters arising from the enactment of the <i>Help to </i><i>Buy Act 2024</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 10 December 2024</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
      </formula>
    </preface>
    <body>
      <section eId="sec-1">
        <num>1</num>
        <heading>Short title</heading>
        <content>
          <p>		This Act is the <i>Help to Buy (Consequential Provisions) Act 2024</i>.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-2">
        <num>2</num>
        <heading>Commencement</heading>
        <subsection eId="sec-2__subsec-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <content>
            <p>Each provision of this Act specified in column 1 of the table commences, or is taken to have commenced, in accordance with column 2 of the table. Any other statement in column 2 has effect according to its terms.</p>
          </content>
          <table>
            <tr>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Column 1</td>
              <td>Column 2</td>
              <td>Column 3</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Provisions</td>
              <td>Commencement</td>
              <td>Date/Details</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>1.  The whole of this Act</td>
              <td>At the same time as the Help to Buy Act 2024 commences.
However, the provisions do not commence at all if that Act does not commence.</td>
              <td>11 December 2024</td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-1" marker="1">
            <content>
              <p>Note:	This table relates only to the provisions of this Act as originally enacted. It will not be amended to deal with any later amendments of this Act.</p>
            </content>
          </authorialNote>
        </subsection>
        <subsection eId="sec-2__subsec-2">
          <num>2</num>
          <content>
            <p>Any information in column 3 of the table is not part of this Act. Information may be inserted in this column, or information in it may be edited, in any published version of this Act.</p>
          </content>
        </subsection>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-3">
        <num>3</num>
        <heading>Schedules</heading>
        <content>
          <p>Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
    </body>
    <attachments>
      <attachment>
        <hcontainer name="schedule" eId="schedule-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <heading>Amendments</heading>
          <hcontainer name="amendedAct" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1">
            <heading>Housing Australia Act 2018</heading>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1">
              <num>1</num>
              <heading>At the end of section 4</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-2" marker="2">
                  <content>
                    <p>Note:	Housing Australia also has functions under the <i>Help to Buy Act 202</i><i>4</i>. Some, but not all, of the provisions of this Act apply in relation to the Help to Buy functions.</p>
                  </content>
                </authorialNote>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2">
              <num>2</num>
              <heading>Section 5</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p><b><i>Help to Buy functions</i></b>: Housing Australia’s <b><i>Help to Buy functions</i></b> are Housing Australia’s functions under the <i>Help to Buy Act</i><i> 202</i><i>4</i>, to the extent that those functions are not also conferred on Housing Australia by:</p>
                </content>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__para-a">
                  <num>a</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>this Act (disregarding paragraph 8(1)(ca) of this Act); or</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__para-b">
                  <num>b</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>	(b)	any Commonwealth law other than the <i>Help to Buy Act 202</i><i>4</i>.</p>
                  </content>
                  <content>
                    <p><b><i>Help to Buy </i></b><b><i>Program </i></b><b><i>Directions</i></b> has the same meaning as in the <i>Help to Buy Act 202</i><i>4</i>.</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3">
              <num>3</num>
              <heading>After paragraph 8(1)(c)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3__qstr-1__para-ca">
                  <num>ca</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>the Help to Buy functions; and</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4">
              <num>4</num>
              <heading>Paragraph 8(1)(d)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>After “Commonwealth law”, insert “(other than the <i>Help to Buy Act 202</i><i>4</i>)”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5">
              <num>5</num>
              <heading>At the end of paragraph 8(1)(e)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add “(other than the Help to Buy functions)”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6">
              <num>6</num>
              <heading>At the end of section 8</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6__qstr-1__subsec-4">
                  <num>4</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>Subsection (3) does not apply in relation to the Help to Buy functions.</p>
                  </content>
                  <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-3" marker="3">
                    <content>
                      <p>Note:	For how Housing Australia must perform the Help to Buy functions, see subsections 10(3), 15(2) and 20(2) of the <i>Help to Buy Act 202</i><i>4</i>.</p>
                    </content>
                  </authorialNote>
                </subsection>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-7">
              <num>7</num>
              <heading>At the end of section 9</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-7__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-7__qstr-1__subsec-3">
                  <num>3</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>This section does not apply in relation to the Help to Buy functions.</p>
                  </content>
                  <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-4" marker="4">
                    <content>
                      <p>Note:	For Housing Australia’s powers in relation to the Help to Buy functions, see sections 11, 16 and 21 of the <i>Help to Buy Act 202</i><i>4</i>.</p>
                    </content>
                  </authorialNote>
                </subsection>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-8">
              <num>8</num>
              <heading>Subsection 12(1) (note)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>After “Note”, insert “1”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-9">
              <num>9</num>
              <heading>At the end of subsection 12(1)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-9__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-5" marker="5">
                  <content>
                    <p>Note 2:	For the Help to Buy functions, see subsection 14(2).</p>
                  </content>
                </authorialNote>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-10">
              <num>10</num>
              <heading>Section 14</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Before “<role refersTo="#minister">The Minister</role>”, insert “(1)”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-11">
              <num>11</num>
              <heading>At the end of section 14</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-11__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-11__qstr-1__subsec-2">
                  <num>2</num>
                  <content>
                    <p><role refersTo="#minister">The Minister</role> must not give a direction under subsection 12(1) about the performance of the Help to Buy functions.</p>
                  </content>
                  <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-6" marker="6">
                    <content>
                      <p>Note:	The Minister may give the Board directions about the Help to Buy functions under Part 3 of the <i>Help to Buy Act 202</i><i>4</i>.</p>
                    </content>
                  </authorialNote>
                </subsection>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-12">
              <num>12</num>
              <heading>Paragraph 16(1)(a)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>After “Investment Mandate”, insert “and the Help to Buy Program Directions”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-13">
              <num>13</num>
              <heading>Subsection 36(4)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>After “<ref href="#dvs-2">Division 2</ref> of <ref href="#part-2">Part 2</ref>”, insert “of this Act, or Part 3 of the <i>Help to Buy Act 202</i><i>4</i>,”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-14">
              <num>14</num>
              <heading>Section 47B</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the section, substitute:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-14__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <section eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-14__qstr-1__sec-47B">
                  <num>47B</num>
                  <heading>Credits to the Account</heading>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-14__qstr-1__sec-47B__subsec-1">
                    <num>1</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>There must be credited to the Account amounts equal to each amount paid to the Commonwealth by Housing Australia that:</p>
                    </content>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-14__qstr-1__sec-47B__subsec-1__para-a">
                      <num>a</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>is a repayment of:</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-14__qstr-1__sec-47B__subsec-1__para-i">
                      <num>i</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>money debited from the Account; or</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-14__qstr-1__sec-47B__subsec-1__para-ii">
                      <num>ii</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>other money lent by the Commonwealth to Housing Australia (whether as described in subsection 50(1) or otherwise); and</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-14__qstr-1__sec-47B__subsec-1__para-b">
                      <num>b</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>is paid in accordance with the Investment Mandate.</p>
                      </content>
                      <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-7" marker="7">
                        <content>
                          <p>Note:	An Act appropriating money for expenditure out of the Consolidated Revenue Fund may contain a provision to the effect that, if any of the purposes of a special account is a purpose that is covered by an item in such an Act (whether or not the item expressly refers to the special account), then amounts may be debited against the appropriation for that item and credited to that special account.</p>
                        </content>
                      </authorialNote>
                    </paragraph>
                  </subsection>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-14__qstr-1__sec-47B__subsec-2">
                    <num>2</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>	(2)	To avoid doubt, subsection (1) does not apply to an amount paid to the Commonwealth by Housing Australia under <ref href="#sec-28">section 28</ref> of the <i>Help to Buy Act 202</i><i>4</i>.</p>
                    </content>
                  </subsection>
                </section>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-15">
              <num>15</num>
              <heading>At the end of section 48</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-15__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-15__qstr-1__subsec-4">
                  <num>4</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>	(4)	This section does not apply in relation to liabilities or defaults under Help to Buy arrangements (within the meaning of the <i>Help to Buy Act 202</i><i>4</i>).</p>
                  </content>
                </subsection>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-16">
              <num>16</num>
              <heading>After subsection 49(4)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-16__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-16__qstr-1__subsec-4A">
                  <num>4A</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>For the purposes of subsection (4), disregard any profit or loss for that year from Housing Australia’s performance of the Help to Buy functions.</p>
                  </content>
                </subsection>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-17">
              <num>17</num>
              <heading>Subsection 50(5)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “or <ref href="#dvs-1">Division 1</ref>”, substitute “, <ref href="#dvs-1">Division 1</ref> of this Part or Part 4 of the <i>Help to Buy Act 202</i><i>4</i>”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-18">
              <num>18</num>
              <heading>Subsection 53(1)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>After “this Act”, insert “or the <i>Help to Buy Act 202</i><i>4</i>”.</p>
                <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
                <p><i>House of Representatives on 30 November 2023</i></p>
                <p><i>Senate on 26 November 2024</i>]</p>
                <p>(158/23)</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
          </hcontainer>
        </hcontainer>
      </attachment>
